# MISSION 3 - THE FIGHT PIT
# Teaches combos, blocking, dodging, stamina and skilled opponents.
mission 3
key m03
title "The Fight Pit"
desc "Under the Ironworks rail yard there's a ring where money changes hands over broken teeth. Eli was seen there before he vanished. Win, and people start talking."
start fight_pit 0 0
requires 2
reward 750

music tension
group crowd civilian - 12 @fight_pit 0 31 7 civilian fists spectate
spawn promoter story civilian @fight_pit -6 8 90 civilian fists stand
name promoter "Sal the Promoter"
invulnerable promoter 1
talk promoter "Sign up [E]" "Sign up with the promoter"
dialogue m03_signup
goto @fight_pit 0 20.5 1.8 "Step into the ring"
notify "Light attacks chain into combos. Mix in F for heavy kicks."
notify "Blocking (RMB) and dodging (Ctrl) cost stamina - watch the yellow bar."
spawn f1 fighter fighter @fight_pit 0 26 180 fighter fists hold
name f1 "Joey 'The Hammer' Rizzo"
nonlethal f1
hostile f1
sound cheer
say announcer "Round one! Fresh meat versus The Hammer!"
defeat f1 "Round 1: Knock out Joey Rizzo"
pit_win
heal
checkpoint
dialogue m03_round2
spawn f2 fighter fighter @fight_pit -2 26 180 fighter fists hold
spawn f2 fighter fighter @fight_pit 2 26 180 fighter fists hold
name f2 "Delgado Twin"
nonlethal f2
hostile f2
sound cheer
defeat f2 "Round 2: Beat the Delgado twins"
pit_win
heal
checkpoint
dialogue m03_brick
spawn brick fighter brick @fight_pit 0 26 180 fighter fists hold
name brick "'Brick' Halloran"
health brick 260
nonlethal brick
hostile brick
music combat
sound cheer
defeat brick "Final: Put Brick Halloran on the canvas"
pit_win
sound cheer
music calm
dialogue m03_win
spawn brick_up story brick @fight_pit 3 22 200 fighter fists stand
name brick_up "'Brick' Halloran"
despawn brick
talk brick_up "Talk [E]" "Talk to Brick"
dialogue m03_brick_talk
evidence 2 @fight_pit 23 36
end
